## Testing

BDD in tasks.md | Unit >80% | `.test.ts` (Vitest)

```typescript
// Vitest pattern: vi.fn() not jest.fn(), import not require
import { vi } from 'vitest';
vi.mock('fs', () => ({ readFile: vi.fn() }));
```
